sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 浏览器/客户端
    participant PreMW as 前置中间件<br>(ErrorHandler/CORS/Logger)
    participant Static as 静态文件/Swagger
    participant Wrapper as ResponseWrapper
    participant Router as Router
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Service as Service
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant WS as WebSocket<br>(Socket.IO)

    Note over Client,DB: ─── HTTP 请求流程 ───

    Client->>PreMW: GET /api/books
    activate PreMW
    PreMW->>PreMW: 错误捕获/CORS/日志记录
    PreMW->>Static: 非静态文件，继续
    activate Static
    Static->>Wrapper: 继续
    deactivate Static
    activate Wrapper
    Wrapper->>Router: 路由匹配
    deactivate Wrapper
    activate Router
    Router->>Controller: listBooks(ctx)
    deactivate Router
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: getBookList()
    deactivate Controller
    activate Service
    Service->>Repo: findAll()
    deactivate Service
    activate Repo
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM ebooks
    deactivate Repo
    DB-->>Repo: 原始数据
    activate Repo
    Repo-->>Service: [Ebook 模型]
    deactivate Repo
    activate Service
    Service->>Service: 映射为 DTO
    Service-->>Controller: [BookDTO]
    deactivate Service
    activate Controller
    Controller-->>Wrapper: ctx.body = data
    deactivate Controller
    activate Wrapper
    Wrapper->>Wrapper: 包装为 {code, data, msg}
    Wrapper-->>Client: 200 JSON
    deactivate Wrapper
    deactivate PreMW

    Note over Client,WS: ─── WebSocket 流程（独立通道） ───

    Client->>WS: 连接 / (Socket.IO)
    WS-->>Client: 连接成功
    Client->>WS: emit('book:list')
    WS->>Service: 调用 bookQuery.getBookList()
    Service-->>WS: 返回数据
    WS-->>Client: callback({ success, data })